# The build context is the server package and the packaged guides, nothing
# else: the root-anchored list this replaced let skills/, docs/ and the
# tests through (a 240 MB context), and its unanchored `.venv` and
# `__pycache__` entries matched only at the root, so mcp/.venv and every
# nested __pycache__ shipped in the image.
*
!mcp
!packages
mcp/tests
mcp/.venv
mcp/uv.lock
mcp/smoke_test.py
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[co]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.DS_Store
